Diretions:
Suppose the student union of your university is organizing an online discussion on college students doing community service. 
You are to write an essay on its benefits and the service you can provide to the community.

#
Nowadays,doing community service has become a common phenomenon. Different people hold different views on it. And I consider it is extremely meaningful for students.
  For one thing, doing community service is a great way to exercice. When we work hard, it is unknown that our body is being stronger. For another,doing community service
is beneficial for mental heathy. At working, we can know the troubles of working and get the knowledge from labor.
  From my perspective, we should organize some voluntary team to take part in community services, only in the way can we know the hard labor.

#修正
  Nowadays, doing community service has become a common phenomenon. Different people hold different views on it. And I consider it extremely meaningful for students.
  For one thing, doing community service is a great way to exercise. When we take part in voluntary work, we can build up our bodies. For another, doing community service is
beneficial for mental health. While working, we can understand the difficulties of ordinary people and gain valuable experience from labor.
  From my perspective, we should organize some voluntary teams to take part in community service. Only in this way can we realize the hardships of labor.

#优化
  Nowadays, doing community service has become a common phenomenon. Different people hold different views on it. And I consider it extremely meaningful for college students.
  For one thing, doing community service helps students develop responsibility and practical skills. We can learn to communicate with different people. For another, it brings 
warmth to residents in the community. We can offer many kinds of help, such as tutoring kids and accompanying the elderly.
  From my perspective, we should actively join in community service. Only in this way can we improve ourselves and contribute to our society.
